# Baseline security headers for every page (security audit 2026-10-02, card
# 9f0e2656). stevoapp.com is the App Store support domain and is shared widely
# (invite / beta / crew pages). HSTS blocks SSL-strip on hostile networks;
# X-Frame-Options + CSP frame-ancestors block clickjacking of the framable
# invite/beta pages; nosniff blocks MIME sniffing. CSP is intentionally
# frame-ancestors/base-uri/form-action only — NOT a default-src lockdown — so it
# cannot break the existing Google-Fonts / inline-style rendering; a full CSP can
# follow once the pages' exact sources are enumerated.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

/.well-known/apple-app-site-association
  Content-Type: application/json
